[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16621.349, "timestamp": "04:37:01", "text": "我的意思是，我确实认识一些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16623.83, "timestamp": "04:37:03", "text": "这样做，但同时又感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16628.23, "timestamp": "04:37:08", "text": "对我来说，做梦就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16631.189, "timestamp": "04:37:11", "text": "有时，我会给你一个可以让你待着的空间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16634.709, "timestamp": "04:37:14", "text": "要知道，要有点傻气，而不是很小。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16636.629, "timestamp": "04:37:16", "text": "有点傻，非常傻，而且我好像并不这么认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16639.99, "timestamp": "04:37:19", "text": "想太多了，你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16642.15, "timestamp": "04:37:22", "text": "呃，我的行为方式或者我喜欢的是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16644.47, "timestamp": "04:37:24", "text": "说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16647.51, "timestamp": "04:37:27", "text": "所以这里是一个我可以待的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16649.51, "timestamp": "04:37:29", "text": "和那种人在一起，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16652.869, "timestamp": "04:37:32", "text": "现实生活中有一个剧本，是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16657.109, "timestamp": "04:37:37", "text": "比如，呃，治疗和学习之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16659.269, "timestamp": "04:37:39", "text": "而这些事情我很多都做不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16661.109, "timestamp": "04:37:41", "text": "做很多事，说很多我做过的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16667.189, "timestamp": "04:37:47", "text": "是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16669.83, "timestamp": "04:37:49", "text": "一直都是这样，不过话说回来，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16671.59, "timestamp": "04:37:51", "text": "这就是为什么我一直坚持这条规则的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16675.59, "timestamp": "04:37:55", "text": "呃，这里不是发泄情绪的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16679.189, "timestamp": "04:37:59", "text": "嗯，又在发泄情绪了。我能理解"}]